00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:35.660
but it was in the 60s and 70s,

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.530
so that was just the norm, we thought.

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:39.990
- [Interviewer] This was from who?

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:40.860
- My parents.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:41.693
- [Interviewer] Your parents?

00:00:41.693 --> 00:00:42.840
- Yes.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:43.910
- [Interviewer] Both parents?

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.330
- My father was the physical
