00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.070
- [Interviewer] So there
were other siblings that-

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:54.903
- Yes.

00:00:54.903 --> 00:00:56.742
- [Interviewer] Went through this?

00:00:56.742 --> 00:00:58.992
And what kind of kid
were you in high school?

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:02.270
- Kind of a loner, trouble.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:04.030
Always in trouble.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.230
Always just trying to
get out of everything.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.123
- [Interviewer] And how
did this affect your life

00:01:11.123 --> 00:01:13.800
