00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:20.460
I needed to be like a
functioning member of society

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:21.870
type thing.

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:26.870
And as a result, I grew up an
old man that's still a loner.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:28.900
Still don't really like
a lot with society.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.650
Don't really trust a lot of people.

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:34.800
- [Interviewer] Have you
ever been married or?

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.150
- Yeah, I was married once.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:38.733
- [Interviewer] Do you have kids?

00:01:38.733 --> 00:01:40.070
