00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:57.170
- [Interviewer] And what kind
of effects does this have

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.470
on your life now, today?

00:01:58.470 --> 00:01:59.560
How old are you today?

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:02.120
- I'm 60, well 58.

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:06.360
- [Interviewer] And how
has this childhood trauma

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:07.970
