00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:12.493
- [Interviewer] Has that helped?

00:02:12.493 --> 00:02:13.563
- Oh yeah, absolutely.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.440
- [Interviewer] Therapy?

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.520
- When I was, after prison they sent me

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:21.770
