day, four or five days a week.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.193
- [Interviewer] Really?

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:42.260
- Yeah, I was, I mean, it was
an in-house, it was a prison.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.093
- [Interviewer] Yeah.

00:02:43.093 --> 00:02:45.010
- It was a prison that they sent us to.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.370
And you either went through
their treatment program

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.330
or you stayed there for-

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.482
- [Interviewer] What kind
