00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:01.020
And the things that you've experienced,

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:02.340
and the way that shapes your thinking,

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:03.750
and the way you make your decisions,

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.140
and your problem solving skills,

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.623
and your conflict resolution skills.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.120
You just starting to work on all of that.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.370
Your work on your arousal management.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.580
Mostly it's getting into

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.970
all the things that contributed to,

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:21.520
