you committed a sexual crime.

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:24.300
All of the thinking errors,
and the emotional inabilities,

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:27.220
and just everything that was just wrong

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.933
about the way you handled things.

00:03:30.168 --> 00:03:31.740
It was pretty intense.

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:33.160
I mean, I never wanted to be there,

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.630
but I'm absolutely glad I was there.

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:38.380
And I got everything
