00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:42.280
- [Interviewer] And do you
feel like you're a better,

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.873
safer member of society now?

00:03:43.873 --> 00:03:44.706
- Absolutely.

00:03:44.706 --> 00:03:45.539
- [Interviewer] Yeah.

00:03:45.539 --> 00:03:48.080
- Absolutely, I've been out 12 years now.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.820
I got arrested once for, I
didn't register properly,

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:55.090
but the registration laws can
be so confusing sometimes.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:57.200
So, I got a registration violation

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:02.030
