00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.190
I got lucky.

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:07.320
I didn't have to go back to prison.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:08.500
'Cause if I'd gone back to prison,

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.710
I probably would have had
