to deal with all that.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:18.170
I've learned what voids
I was trying to fill,

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.133
what needs I was trying to satisfy.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:24.603
The sad thing is, as a human being we're,

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:30.010
our sexuality is so hardwired
into who and what we are

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:33.450
that to try to deal with,
you end up developing some,

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.390
I mean, I don't wanna
put a light coat on it,

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.830
but you end up developing
what we call an appetite.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:39.270
A desire.

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:42.440
And some of those desires
may never go away,

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:47.360
but you just have to learn
how to rearrange your life,

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:49.500
relive your life, so that
you're not putting yourself

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.350
in situations where there are temptations.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:56.190
I haven't thought about molesting a child.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:59.860
I haven't indulged in any
of the deviant fantasies

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.220
that I've had prior.

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:05.810
Because I've learned how to
address me, how to carry me,

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:10.580
how to move myself forward
instead of living in the now.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.310
I learned how to look forward a little bit

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:15.183
and not set myself up where
there could be a problem.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:17.600
It's like any other addiction.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:20.150
A sexual addiction is
like any other addiction.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:22.100
And you just, you gotta learn

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.440
what it is that you were trying to fill,

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.700
what void it is, what pain
you were trying to cover,

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:27.480
or what thought, whatever it was

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:28.590
you thought you were missing.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:31.690
Or whatever shortcomings you
thought you had to overcome,

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:34.630
you had to learn to live
your life in such a way

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:38.760
that those decisions
don't come back up, so.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:41.140
