00:06:14.843 --> 00:06:16.000
- Absolutely.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.830
When I went into therapy, I
was absolutely a psychopath.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:22.010
There's actually a test for that.

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:23.940
The Hare PCL-R test.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:28.520
And I scored psychopathy off the charts.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.160
A normal person is somewhere 12 to 18,

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.200
I scored in the 30s.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.430
But through the treatment and through

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:37.460
the work that I was able to do,

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.250
got myself back down to a normal score

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.593
in the mid teens, low teens.

00:06:44.248 --> 00:06:47.070
And again, it's just as a sex offender,

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:48.467
and I think as a human being,

00:06:48.467 --> 00:06:51.800
we can't cause harm to another human being

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:54.500
without giving ourselves
some kind of a justification,

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.020
some kind of a permission.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.570
We have to convince ourselves
in some kind of way,

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:00.120
although it's irrational,

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.420
that it's okay to do what we're doing.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:06.780
And, as a result of that, you
lose what they call empathy.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:09.843
You're not able to emotionally
connect with other people.

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:13.730
And that's what allows you
to harm another human being.

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:16.480
Well, learning how to
reconnect with people

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:20.820
at an emotional level was,
it was a long and hard trip.

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:22.720
It took a lot of work and it was not,

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:24.800
I can't say that any
step of it was pleasant,

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:29.160
but the end result was that,
I'm one of the fortunate ones

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:33.277
that got to get plugged
back into the human society.

00:07:33.277 --> 00:07:34.730
- [Interviewer] Are you happier now?

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:35.563
