00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:04.472
And so, there's just no need for me,

00:10:04.472 --> 00:10:06.580
I'm much happier without my family.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.280
I don't want to be a part of their lives.

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:11.290
And as far as I know,

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.390
