00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:16.960
- [Interviewer] And what's
the most important lesson

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.000
you feel like you've learned?

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.700
- [Bill] My most important lesson?

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.560
To be honest with myself, you know what?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:24.740
You don't have to be perfect.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:26.990
Everything doesn't have to feel good.

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:28.440
Sometimes there's just bad feelings.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.883
Sometimes things aren't
perfect, and that's okay.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.530
You try to hold yourself up to
such a standard of perfection

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.330
that you can't possibly
meet, and as a result,

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:42.280
