your emotional wounds

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.430
of falling short of who you
think you're supposed to be.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:48.130
And I found some pretty
screwed up ways of doing that.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:52.010
- [Interviewer] It's almost
like you re-parented yourself

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:53.480
